  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 1633.01 Drivers",
  "priorExpiration": "2005-01-10",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 1633.01 Drivers. Vehicles transporting blasting agents shall only be driven by and be in charge of a driver at least 21 years of age who is capable, careful, reliable and in possession of a valid motor vehicle operator's license. Such person shall also be familiar with the vehicle and traffic laws of the state of New Hampshire.\n\nSource. #2220, eff 12-31-82; ss by #2837, eff 8-27-84; ss by #4584, eff 3-3-89; ss by #5996, INTERIM, eff 3-3-95, EXPIRES, 7-1-95; ss by #6054, eff 7-1-95, EXPIRED: 7-1-03\n\nNew. #8116, INTERIM, eff 7-14-04, EXPIRES: 1-10-05; ss by #8231, eff 12-20-04; ss by #10396, eff 8-15-13",
